#. Terms.
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "usage.terms1"
msgid "One check-in per UTC day, sent at startup or day rollover. If it does not get through, the same token is offered again once a minute, at most 10 times that day, and never for a past day. Only a token that changes daily is sent. No account details, inventory, screenshots, hardware identifiers, or activity events. Turning this off stops future check-ins; previous aggregate counts remain."
